00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.160
but we haven't done it live yet.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.360
So we got to mix it in there a little bit.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.193
So I was very excited.

00:00:37.193 --> 00:00:38.790
- Oh, I know we did that
for a documentary call.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:39.930
- Yes.
- Still working nine to five.

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:40.890
- Yeah.
- So there's a version.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:42.510
