00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:45.203
- Yeah, still relevant.

00:00:45.203 --> 00:00:46.470
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:49.110
Is it true that you invited
women at your record label

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:49.943
